      'Per-channel Discord': 'Discord por canal',
      '): each channel can mirror to its own Discord channel via webhook (trade → #market, staff → #staff), taking priority over the global webhook.': '): cada canal puede reflejarse a su propio canal de Discord vía webhook (trade → #market, staff → #staff), con prioridad sobre el webhook global.',
      'Each GLOBAL channel keeps a rolling in-memory history (': 'Cada canal GLOBAL mantiene un historial rotativo en memoria (',
